{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a homepage product feature section in dark theme that matches the store's design system exactly. Reference image shows a product page layout for "Rati - The Ritual" massage oil. Build this as a Shopify OS 2.0 section with blocks.
    
    DESIGN SYSTEM (must match exactly — no hardcoded overrides):
    - Background: #0d0d0d (var --bodybg)
    - Body text color: #b0b0b0, font-size: 14px, line-height: 1.6, letter-spacing: 2px
    - Heading color: #eeeeee, font-size: 35px (desktop), font-weight: 500, line-height: 1.5
    - Font family: Use CSS variable --font-heading-family (Aleo) for headings, --font-body-family for body
    - Subheading/italic: same font family, italic style, color #b0b0b0
    - Primary button (btn4): background #b1ff15, text #000000, border #b6ff00, hover bg #000000, hover text #fff — font: uppercase, weight 700, font-size 12px (use theme btn classes: btn btn4)
    - Border/divider color: #333333
    - Border radius: 0px (rad: 0)
    - Section border: #333333
    
    SECTION LAYOUT (matching reference image):
    Split layout — left: product image with thumbnail gallery strip below; right: product details
    
    LEFT COLUMN:
    - Large main product image (square, no border radius)
    - Thumbnail strip below (5 small images, horizontally scrollable, clickable to swap main image)
    - Below thumbnails: a quote block — star icons (filled, color #b1ff15) + italic quote text in body font
    
    RIGHT COLUMN (top to bottom):
    - Breadcrumb text: small, #b0b0b0, letter-spacing 2px, uppercase, 12px
    - Product title: heading font, 35px, weight 500, color #eeeeee
    - Subtitle/tagline: italic, body font, 16px, color #b0b0b0
    - Star rating row: filled stars (#b1ff15) + rating number + review count in #b0b0b0
    - Promo badge: small pill/tag — "FIRST ORDER: USE CODE RATI20 FOR 20% OFF" — background #1a1a1a, border #333333, text #b0b0b0, font-size 11px, uppercase, letter-spacing 2px
    - Price: large, 22px, font-weight 500, color #ffffff — with size note below in #b0b0b0 12px
    - Pack selector: two cards side by side — "1 Pack" and "2 Pack" — each card: background #1a1a1a, border #333333, selected state border #b1ff15; inside each card: pack label (14px, #eeeeee), savings badge (small pill, bg #b1ff15, text #000, 10px uppercase), price (16px, #ffffff), compare-at price (strikethrough, #b0b0b0, 12px)
    - ADD TO CART button: full width, btn4 class, uppercase, font-weight 700
    - Product description paragraph: body font, 14px, #b0b0b0, line-height 1.6, inside a subtle box (bg #1a1a1a, border #333333, padding 16px)
    - Tag pills row: small uppercase tags — "PRESENCE OVER PERFORMANCE", "RATI IS FOR ALL", "BEAT THE STRESS", "MAKE THE FIRST MOVE", "UNFREEZE THE MOMENT" — bg transparent, border #333333, text #b0b0b0, 10px, letter-spacing 2px
    - Certifications grid: 2x2 grid of small boxes (bg #1a1a1a, border #333333) — ISO 9001 VALID JUL 2026, ISO 22716 COSMETICS GMP, GMP C068 VALID JUN 2029, FDA APPROVED — label in #b0b0b0 10px uppercase, value in #eeeeee 12px
    - Feature badges row: pill tags — DERMAT TESTED, PARABEN FREE, SILICONE FREE, PH BALANCED, MINERAL OIL FREE — same style as tag pills
    - Footer note: "COA | MSDS | Derma Report available on request" — 11px, #b0b0b0, letter-spacing 1px
    - Accordion blocks: DESCRIPTION, INGREDIENTS, HOW TO USE, CAUTIONS — each a collapsible row with border-bottom #333333, heading #eeeeee 13px uppercase letter-spacing 2px, content #b0b0b0 14px
    
    BLOCKS (make all content editable via theme editor schema):
    - Block: Product Image (image picker)
    - Block: Thumbnail Images (up to 5 image pickers)
    - Block: Quote (text + star count)
    - Block: Breadcrumb (text)
    - Block: Product Title (text)
    - Block: Subtitle (text)
    - Block: Rating (number + review count)
    - Block: Promo Badge (text)
    - Block: Price (text for price, size note)
    - Block: Pack Option (x2 — label, savings text, price, compare price)
    - Block: Button (label, link)
    - Block: Description Box (richtext)
    - Block: Tag Pills (up to 8 tags as text fields)
    - Block: Certifications (up to 4: label + value)
    - Block: Feature Badges (up to 8 badge labels)
    - Block: Footer Note (text)
    - Block: Accordion Item (heading + richtext content, collapsible)
    
    Use vanilla JS for thumbnail swap and accordion toggle. No external dependencies. All CSS scoped to section. Fully responsive — stack to single column on mobile.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{%- liquid
  # ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Data layer — everything is sourced from the selected product + its metafields.
  # No product-specific content is stored in section settings.
  # Resolution order: the picked product wins; otherwise fall back to the product
  # of the current template (so the block works automatically on product pages).
  # ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  assign current_product = product
  assign product = block.settings.product | default: current_product
  assign mf = product.metafields.custom

  assign selected_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign product_form_id = 'product-form-' | append: ai_gen_id

  # Metafield-driven copy (all optional, graceful fallbacks)
  assign subtitle = mf.subtitle
  assign short_description = mf.short_description
  assign quote_text = mf.quote
  assign promo_text = mf.promo_badge
  assign footer_note = mf.footer_note
  assign price_note = mf.price_note
  assign rating_value = mf.rating_value
  assign review_count = mf.review_count

  # Breadcrumb derived from the product's own taxonomy
  assign first_collection = product.collections.first
-%}

{% style %}
  .ai-product-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: #0d0d0d;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 60px 0;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 80px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-main-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-main-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-thumbnails-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: #333333 #0d0d0d;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-thumbnails-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    height: 6px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-thumbnails-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background: #0d0d0d;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-thumbnails-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: #333333;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-thumbnail-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid #333333;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-thumbnail-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    border-color: #b1ff15;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-thumbnail-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #333333;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    fill: #b1ff15;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-quote-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #b0b0b0;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-breadcrumb-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 35px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #eeeeee;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-rating-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-rating-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    fill: #b1ff15;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-rating-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #b0b0b0;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-promo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #333333;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-price-amount-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-price-note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-pack-selector-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-pack-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #333333;
    padding: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-pack-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}.selected {
    border-color: #b1ff15;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-pack-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #eeeeee;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-pack-savings-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #b1ff15;
    color: #000000;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-pack-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-pack-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #b1ff15;
    color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #b6ff00;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
  }
  .ai-product-feature-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}[disabled],
  .ai-product-feature-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.disabled {
    opacity: 0.55;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .ai-product-feature-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} .loading__spinner {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin-left: 8px;
  }
  .ai-product-feature-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} .loading__spinner.hidden {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #333333;
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-tags-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #333333;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #b0b0b0;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-certifications-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-cert-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #333333;
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-cert-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-cert-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #eeeeee;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-badges-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #333333;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #b0b0b0;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-footer-note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-top: 1px solid #333333;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333333;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-accordion-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-accordion-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #eeeeee;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-accordion-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #eeeeee;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-product-feature-accordion-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .ai-product-feature-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-product-feature-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 200px;
    max-height: 200px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-product-feature-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 30px;
    }

    .ai-product-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .ai-product-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-product-feature-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 15px;
    }

    .ai-product-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .ai-product-feature-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      position: static;
    }

    .ai-product-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .ai-product-feature-pack-selector-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<product-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-product-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  data-atc-text="{{ block.settings.button_text | default: 'ADD TO CART' | escape }}"
  data-sold-out-text="{{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t | escape }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-product-feature-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {%- if product == blank -%}
      {% comment %} Onboarding state — shown until a product is selected in the theme editor {% endcomment %}
      <div class="ai-product-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-product-feature-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-product-feature-main-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-product-feature-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-product-feature-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-product-feature-breadcrumb-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Home / Shop</div>
          <h2 class="ai-product-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Select a product</h2>
          <div class="ai-product-feature-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Choose a product in the theme editor and this section fills in automatically.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="ai-product-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-product-feature-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {%- assign main_image = selected_variant.featured_image | default: product.featured_image -%}
          <div class="ai-product-feature-main-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-main-image>
            {% if main_image %}
              <img src="{{ main_image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ main_image.alt | escape }}" width="{{ main_image.width }}" height="{{ main_image.height }}" loading="lazy">
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-product-feature-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          {% if block.settings.show_thumbnails and product.images.size > 0 %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-thumbnails-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% for image in product.images %}
                <div class="ai-product-feature-thumbnail-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% if main_image and image.id == main_image.id %} active{% endif %}" data-thumbnail data-image="{{ image | image_url: width: 800 }}">
                  <img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 100 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}" width="80" height="80" loading="lazy">
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.show_quote and quote_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-product-feature-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% for i in (1..5) %}
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-product-feature-quote-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ quote_text }}</div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-product-feature-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-product-feature-breadcrumb-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{- 'general.breadcrumbs.home' | t -}}
            {%- if first_collection %} / {{ first_collection.title }}{% endif -%}
            {%- if product.type != blank %} / {{ product.type }}{% endif -%}
          </div>

          <h1 class="ai-product-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h1>

          {% if subtitle != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ subtitle }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.show_rating and rating_value != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-product-feature-rating-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% for i in (1..5) %}
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
              <span class="ai-product-feature-rating-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ rating_value }}{% if review_count != blank %} ({{ review_count }} reviews){% endif %}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if promo_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-promo-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ promo_text }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-product-feature-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-product-feature-price-amount-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-price-target>{{ selected_variant.price | money }}</div>
          </div>
          {% if price_note != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-price-note-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ price_note }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.show_pack_selector and product.variants.size > 1 %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-pack-selector-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% for variant in product.variants %}
                {%- liquid
                  assign v_image = variant.featured_image | default: product.featured_image
                  assign save_pct = 0
                  if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price
                    assign save_pct = variant.compare_at_price | minus: variant.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: variant.compare_at_price | round
                  endif
                -%}
                <div class="ai-product-feature-pack-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% if variant.id == selected_variant.id %} selected{% endif %}"
                  data-pack-card
                  data-variant-id="{{ variant.id }}"
                  data-price="{{ variant.price | money }}"
                  data-available="{{ variant.available }}"
                  {% if v_image %}data-image="{{ v_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"{% endif %}>
                  <div class="ai-product-feature-pack-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ variant.title }}</div>
                  {% if save_pct > 0 %}
                    <div class="ai-product-feature-pack-savings-{{ ai_gen_id }}">SAVE {{ save_pct }}%</div>
                  {% endif %}
                  <div class="ai-product-feature-pack-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ variant.price | money }}</div>
                  {% if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price %}
                    <div class="ai-product-feature-pack-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ variant.compare_at_price | money }}</div>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {%- assign atc_disabled = false -%}
          {%- if product.available == false or selected_variant == nil -%}{%- assign atc_disabled = true -%}{%- endif -%}
          <product-form class="ai-product-feature-form-wrap-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-section="{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-hide-errors="false">
            {%- form 'product', product, id: product_form_id, novalidate: 'novalidate' -%}
              <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ selected_variant.id }}"{% if atc_disabled %} disabled{% endif %}>
              <button type="submit" name="add" class="ai-product-feature-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"{% if atc_disabled %} disabled{% endif %}>
                <span>
                  {%- if product.available == false -%}{{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}
                  {%- elsif selected_variant == nil -%}{{ 'products.product.unavailable' | t }}
                  {%- else -%}{{ block.settings.button_text | default: 'ADD TO CART' }}{%- endif -%}
                </span>
                <div class="loading__spinner hidden"><svg class="at-icon at-spin" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#icon-loading"></use></svg></div>
              </button>
              <div class="product-form__error-message-wrapper" role="alert" hidden>
                <span class="product-form__error-message"></span>
              </div>
            {%- endform -%}
          </product-form>

          {%- assign box_desc = short_description | default: product.description -%}
          {% if block.settings.show_description and box_desc != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {%- if short_description != blank -%}<p>{{ short_description }}</p>{%- else -%}{{ product.description }}{%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.show_tags and mf.tag_pills != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-tags-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% for tag in mf.tag_pills.value %}
                <div class="ai-product-feature-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ tag }}</div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.show_certifications and mf.certifications != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-certifications-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% for cert in mf.certifications.value %}
                <div class="ai-product-feature-cert-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <div class="ai-product-feature-cert-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ cert.label }}</div>
                  <div class="ai-product-feature-cert-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ cert.value }}</div>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.show_badges and mf.feature_badges != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-badges-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% for badge in mf.feature_badges.value %}
                <div class="ai-product-feature-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ badge }}</div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if footer_note != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-footer-note-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ footer_note }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.show_accordion and mf.accordion_items != blank %}
            <div class="ai-product-feature-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% for item in mf.accordion_items.value %}
                {% if item.title != blank %}
                  <div class="ai-product-feature-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-accordion-item>
                    <button type="button" class="ai-product-feature-accordion-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-accordion-header aria-expanded="false">
                      <span class="ai-product-feature-accordion-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ item.title }}</span>
                      <span class="ai-product-feature-accordion-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">▼</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="ai-product-feature-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-accordion-content>
                      {{ item.content }}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</product-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class ProductFeature{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      connectedCallback() {
        this.thumbnails = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-thumbnail]'));
        this.mainImg = this.querySelector('[data-main-image] img');
        this.setupThumbnails();
        this.setupPackSelector();
        this.setupAccordion();
        this.setupSwipe();
      }

      /* Swap the main gallery image and keep the matching thumbnail highlighted */
      showImage(url) {
        if (this.mainImg && url) this.mainImg.src = url;
        this.thumbnails.forEach((t) => t.classList.toggle('active', t.getAttribute('data-image') === url));
      }

      setupThumbnails() {
        if (!this.mainImg || this.thumbnails.length === 0) return;
        this.thumbnails.forEach((thumbnail) => {
          thumbnail.addEventListener('click', () => {
            this.showImage(thumbnail.getAttribute('data-image'));
          });
        });
      }

      /* Pack cards drive real variant selection: price, image, availability + cart id */
      setupPackSelector() {
        const packCards = this.querySelectorAll('[data-pack-card]');
        if (!packCards.length) return;

        const idInput = this.querySelector('input[name="id"]');
        const priceTarget = this.querySelector('[data-price-target]');
        const submit = this.querySelector('[name="add"]');
        const submitText = submit ? submit.querySelector('span') : null;
        const atcText = this.dataset.atcText || 'ADD TO CART';
        const soldOutText = this.dataset.soldOutText || 'Sold out';

        packCards.forEach((card) => {
          card.addEventListener('click', () => {
            packCards.forEach((c) => c.classList.remove('selected'));
            card.classList.add('selected');

            const variantId = card.getAttribute('data-variant-id');
            const price = card.getAttribute('data-price');
            const available = card.getAttribute('data-available') === 'true';
            const image = card.getAttribute('data-image');

            if (idInput && variantId) {
              idInput.value = variantId;
              idInput.removeAttribute('disabled');
              idInput.dispatchEvent(new Event('change', { bubbles: true }));
            }
            if (priceTarget && price) priceTarget.innerHTML = price;
            if (image) this.showImage(image);

            if (submit) {
              submit.toggleAttribute('disabled', !available);
              if (submitText) submitText.textContent = available ? atcText : soldOutText;
            }
          });
        });
      }

      /* Basic left/right swipe on the main image for mobile */
      setupSwipe() {
        const main = this.querySelector('[data-main-image]');
        const urls = this.thumbnails.map((t) => t.getAttribute('data-image')).filter(Boolean);
        if (!main || urls.length < 2) return;

        let startX = 0;
        main.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => { startX = e.changedTouches[0].clientX; }, { passive: true });
        main.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => {
          const dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - startX;
          if (Math.abs(dx) < 40) return;
          let idx = this.thumbnails.findIndex((t) => t.classList.contains('active'));
          if (idx < 0) idx = 0;
          idx = dx < 0 ? (idx + 1) % urls.length : (idx - 1 + urls.length) % urls.length;
          this.showImage(urls[idx]);
        }, { passive: true });
      }

      setupAccordion() {
        const accordionItems = this.querySelectorAll('[data-accordion-item]');

        accordionItems.forEach((item) => {
          const header = item.querySelector('[data-accordion-header]');
          const content = item.querySelector('[data-accordion-content]');

          if (!header || !content) return;

          header.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const isActive = item.classList.contains('active');

            accordionItems.forEach((i) => {
              i.classList.remove('active');
              const c = i.querySelector('[data-accordion-content]');
              if (c) c.style.maxHeight = null;
              const h = i.querySelector('[data-accordion-header]');
              if (h) h.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
            });

            if (!isActive) {
              item.classList.add('active');
              content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + 'px';
              header.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
            }
          });
        });
      }
    }

    if (!customElements.get('product-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}')) {
      customElements.define('product-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}', ProductFeature{{ ai_gen_id }});
    }
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product feature",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "product",
      "label": "Product",
      "info": "Leave empty on a product template to use the current product automatically. All content (images, title, price, variants, description, metafields) is pulled from the product."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_text",
      "label": "Add to cart label",
      "default": "ADD TO CART"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Display options"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_thumbnails",
      "label": "Show thumbnail gallery",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_quote",
      "label": "Show quote (metafield custom.quote)",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_rating",
      "label": "Show rating (metafields custom.rating_value / custom.review_count)",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_pack_selector",
      "label": "Show pack / variant selector",
      "info": "Shown automatically when the product has more than one variant.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_description",
      "label": "Show description box",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_tags",
      "label": "Show tag pills (metafield custom.tag_pills)",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_certifications",
      "label": "Show certifications (metafield custom.certifications)",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_badges",
      "label": "Show feature badges (metafield custom.feature_badges)",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_accordion",
      "label": "Show accordion (metafield custom.accordion_items)",
      "default": true
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Product feature"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}